--
^CONVERSION ERROR$
found no match for symbol 'with_source_location'
--
Regression for rvalue-receiver member call dispatch.

Without the fix, `std::move(receiver).method()` against an
`&&`-qualified `method()` is rejected with

    found no match for symbol 'method'

because cpp_typecheck_conversions::reference_binding
incorrectly applied the C++11 "xvalue cannot bind to non-const
lvalue ref" rule to the implicit `this` parameter (internally
encoded as an lvalue ref to a pointer).  Fixed by skipping that
check when `reference_type.get_bool(ID_C_this)` is true.
